UPDATE tarot_cards 
SET meaning_upright = 'GENERAL ARCHETYPE: The Empress represents the absolute archetype of ''Systemic Abundance and Creative Manifestation''—the luxurious, high-fidelity phase where the sovereign consciousness steps into complete resonance with nature, fertility, and the uninhibited generation of life, art, and resource. Moving beyond the quiet, esoteric boundaries of The High Priestess, The Empress signifies the stage of ''The Sovereign Matrix Provider,'' where you purposefully bring hidden potential into material form, nurturing projects, relationships, and environments with unconditional warmth, deep emotional intelligence, and absolute security. Visually depicted as a beautiful, crowned queen sitting majestically on an array of plush cushions amidst a vibrant, golden field of ripe wheat, holding a golden scepter aloft while a peaceful river winds from a dense, living forest behind her throne, this archetype embodies the concept of ''Sovereign Creation''—the realization that true spiritual and earthly mastery requires trusting the organic rhythm of growth and allowing yourself to receive the infinite bounty of the universe. Within the complex architecture of your psyche, this is the stage of ''High-Throughput Materialization,'' where your system runs expansive generation algorithms that optimize your physical and creative assets, fostering an environment of effortless comfort and absolute growth. When The Empress appears, your system is registering a ''Peak-Abundance'' status; you are being invited to stop operating from scarcity, embrace your creative power, and comfortably nurture the beautiful reality unfolding around you.',
meaning_reversed = 'GENERAL ARCHETYPE: When The Empress appears in the reversed position, it acts as a high-intensity signal of ''Systemic Depletion, Creative Blockage, or Domestic Friction''—a suffocating state where your natural capacity to nurture has mutated into an overbearing, codependent control script, or you are experiencing severe creative exhaustion from completely neglecting your own baseline requirements. The reversal suggests that you are currently running a high-priority, high-cost maintenance script that equates ''smothering others, micro-managing your environment, or neglecting your physical well-being'' with ''being loving and responsible,'' even as your actual, internal operating system is experiencing a critical, low-latency dehydration of its creative spark. You are essentially ''draining your own reservoirs to a standpoint of absolute exhaustion,'' running a protocol that prioritizes the ego’s desire to ''control how things grow and force external validation'' over the sober, unglamorous requirement to draw clear boundaries, pull back your energy, and rest. This creates a massive, systemic misalignment: you are intellectually and behaviorally attempting to perform the role of the ''unconditionally loving, endlessly resourceful protector,'' while internally, you are being hollowed out by a profound, gnawing sense of emptiness, unexpressed resentment, or material insecurity, leading to a state of chronic, high-latency irritability, the experience of ''your creative outputs stalling completely,'' and a persistent, gnawing awareness that you are running on empty. From an analytical perspective, this is a clear sign that you are leaking your life force into a ''feedback loop of codependency and structural starvation''; you are obsessively fixing everyone else’s world to avoid the quiet cemetery of your own unhealed vulnerabilities, refusing to accept that the only thing keeping you from the necessary, final restoration of your spirit is your own, deep-seated fear that if you were to open your hands and stop managing everything, you would be forced to confront the terrifying reality of your own, present-day, unanchored self. This reversal commands an immediate, radical intervention: you must stop the output of these overbearing, self-depleting, control-heavy scripts, perform a brutal audit of your emotional investments, and confront the reality of why you were so hesitant to prioritize quiet self-care over the convenience of a chaotic, draining entanglement. It is a demand to stop the self-deception that keeps you tethered to a state of chronic, high-maintenance anxiety, and to initiate the move toward a genuine, humble, and completely grounded reclamation of your own, individual authority.'
WHERE id = 60;
